# Force LF line endings on checkout (all platforms).
#
# WHY: CI runs `ruff format --check` on windows-latest, where git checks out
# files with CRLF by default. Ruff counts the CR as part of the line, so
# lines that are exactly <=100 cols with LF exceed the limit with CRLF and
# `ruff format --check` fails on Windows while passing on Linux/macOS.
# Enforcing LF everywhere makes the format check deterministic per platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never get line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
